1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,860
In the hardest rooms I've sat in, I found out that laughter's free

2
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:14,580
It's a medicine they don't sell, and it worked the best on me

3
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:21,780
If you can laugh through the cancer, laugh through the hurting and the grief

4
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:28,900
You steal the power from the dark and turn the devil into a thief

5
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,900
Now there's people I've never met who play my songs at night

6
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:36,580
And they write to say my words help them make it through a fight

7
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:40,020
So if you're out there listening, I want you to know it's true

8
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:44,100
All the love you've got for these words is the same love I've got for you
